00:27:27.460 --> 00:27:36.160
scene where Dwight discovers these boxes of supplies that Michael has packed in the back of the bus.
场景是德怀特发现了迈克尔在巴士后座打包的这些物资箱。

513
00:27:36.760 --> 00:27:39.880
