我们要进行日本商务演习吗？

520
00:27:54.220 --> 00:27:56.720
But none of the other supplies are seen.
但其他物资都没出现。

521
00:27:56.880 --> 00:28:00.740
And I guess my whole point is, fine, fine, Jenna.
我想说的是，行吧，行吧，珍娜。

522
00:28:00.860 --> 00:28:02.440
He had the supplies on the back of the bus.
他确实在巴士后座放了物资。

523
00:28:02.560 --> 00:28:03.500
Who's setting them up?
是谁在布置它们？

524
00:28:03.880 --> 00:28:08.480
Where's my B-roll footage of Dwight having to run around and stab tiki torches in the ground?
我那段德怀特不得不跑来跑去把火把插在地上的空镜素材去哪了？

525
00:28:09.040 --> 00:28:15.880
Well, I know I'm jumping ahead, but later we're going to see two guys setting a giant fire pit thing.
好吧，我知道我跳得太快了，但稍后我们会看到两个人在布置一个巨大的火坑之类的东西。

526
00:28:16.040 --> 00:28:17.260
With a red pickup truck.
还有一辆红色皮卡车。

527
00:28:17.260 --> 00:28:18.260
Who are these dudes?
这些家伙是谁？

528
00:28:18.780 --> 00:28:19.520
I guess.
我猜。

529
00:28:19.520 --> 00:28:20.480
I don't know.
我不知道。

530
00:28:20.620 --> 00:28:21.880
Michael had some assistance.
迈克尔找了帮手。

531
00:28:22.080 --> 00:28:22.340
Okay.
好吧。

532
00:28:22.340 --> 00:28:24.740
