我想也是。

534
00:28:26.720 --> 00:28:33.640
Well, during this egg race, at 9 minutes, 54 seconds, you can fully see Mindy starting to laugh.
好吧，在这次鸡蛋比赛中，在9分54秒时，你可以清楚地看到敏迪开始笑了。

535
00:28:33.960 --> 00:28:34.500
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

536
00:28:34.940 --> 00:28:40.760
When Ed is yelling at her, when she's afraid she's going to run into the big rock, she starts laughing.
当艾德对她大喊大叫时，当她害怕自己会撞上那块大石头时，她开始笑了。

537
00:28:41.980 --> 00:28:42.480
Yes.
是的。

538
00:28:42.480 --> 00:28:51.120
