我个人很喜欢瑞安对德怀特说的那句，如果你继续对我大喊大叫，我就不干了。

539
00:28:51.320 --> 00:28:52.900
I'm going to stop this race.
我就要停止这场比赛了。

540
00:28:53.100 --> 00:28:57.720
And he doesn't stop shouting, so he just takes off his blindfold and throws his spoon on the ground.
但他没有停止大喊，所以他直接摘下眼罩，把勺子扔在了地上。

541
00:28:57.720 --> 00:29:07.120
Now, Jenna, I think there's a portion of that scene, that was an on-the-fly kind of scene, and that was improvised dialogue between BJ and Rain.
珍娜，我觉得那场戏有一部分是即兴发挥的，那是BJ和雷恩之间的即兴对话。

542
00:29:07.280 --> 00:29:09.020
That's what they talked about in the DVD commentary.
他们在DVD评论音轨里提到过这一点。

543
00:29:09.140 --> 00:29:09.240
Yes.
是的。

544
00:29:09.240 --> 00:29:09.860
Do you remember that?
你还记得吗？

545
00:29:10.220 --> 00:29:10.620
Yes.
记得。

546
00:29:10.620 --> 00:29:11.400
Yes, that's right.
是的，没错。

547
00:29:11.700 --> 00:29:17.180
Well, now Pam has her talking head, where we see that she's taking her diligent notes.
好吧，现在是帕姆的采访镜头，我们看到她在认真地做笔记。

548
00:29:17.580 --> 00:29:22.760
And we had some fan questions from Lily S., Ashley Hildreth, and Madison Barton.
我们收到了一些来自莉莉·S、阿什莉·希尔德雷斯和麦迪逊·巴顿的粉丝提问。

549
00:29:23.200 --> 00:29:25.540
Jenna, did you really write the notes?
珍娜，你真的写了那些笔记吗？

550
00:29:25.540 --> 00:29:27.440
