如果是的话，你写了些什么？

551
00:29:28.660 --> 00:29:29.560
I'm with you.
我支持你。

552
00:29:29.720 --> 00:29:30.620
I want to know, too.
我也想知道。

553
00:29:30.800 --> 00:29:35.480
I'm like, I know my BFF, and I'm guessing you actually were writing things down.
我心想，我了解我最好的朋友，我猜你当时肯定在写些什么。

554
00:29:35.660 --> 00:29:36.400
What were you doing?
你当时在做什么？

555
00:29:37.340 --> 00:29:38.940
I was taking diligent notes.
我在认真做笔记。

556
00:29:39.040 --> 00:29:39.860
I knew it!
我就知道！

557
00:29:39.860 --> 00:29:40.920
I knew it!
我就知道！

558
00:29:41.540 --> 00:29:42.520
In character.
很符合角色设定。

559
00:29:42.840 --> 00:29:49.580
Yeah, so there's a moment where I hold up my notebook, and I tried to freeze on it to see if I could copy down what it said.
是啊，有个镜头是我举起笔记本，我试着定格画面，想看看能不能抄下上面写的内容。

560
00:29:49.800 --> 00:30:00.480
And it was too fuzzy, but you can see that I am writing, you know, Dwight did this, Dwight did that, Jim did this.
画面太模糊了，但你能看到我在写，你知道的，德怀特做了这个，德怀特做了那个，吉姆做了那个。

561
00:30:00.660 --> 00:30:09.240
I thought that the best way to get through those scenes was to actually write down what was happening around me, as if I was in character.
我觉得应付那些场景最好的办法就是真的把周围发生的事情写下来，就像我真的在角色里一样。

562
00:30:10.180 --> 00:30:12.040
I figured you were.
我猜你就是这么做的。

563
00:30:12.400 --> 00:30:14.800
So you can see Michael is losing people.
所以你能看到迈克尔正在失去大家的注意力。

564
00:30:15.080 --> 00:30:17.380
Like, Stanley is so happy Phyllis dropped the egg.
比如，斯坦利看到菲利斯把蛋掉在地上，他可高兴了。

565
00:30:17.460 --> 00:30:18.420
He's going to go sit down.
他打算去坐下。

566
00:30:18.660 --> 00:30:20.980
He's going to do his crossword on his lawn chair.
他打算坐在他的折叠椅上做填字游戏。

567
00:30:21.600 --> 00:30:28.220
Creed wanders off, and in the background, we see him catch a fish with his bare hands.
克里德走开了，在背景里，我们看到他徒手抓到了一条鱼。

568
00:30:28.780 --> 00:30:29.320
Yeah.
没错。

569
00:30:30.400 --> 00:30:34.040
Well, there's a really fun little tidbit about that on the DVD commentary.
关于那个镜头，DVD评论音轨里有个特别有趣的幕后花絮。

570
00:30:34.940 --> 00:30:37.220
Harold said, you guys, this is how we did it.
哈罗德说，伙计们，我们是这样拍的。

571
00:30:37.440 --> 00:30:42.140
There was a rubber fish that they sort of submerged, like, in a bucket.
他们把一条橡胶鱼浸泡在水桶里。

572
00:30:42.380 --> 00:30:45.580
What you can't see is this rubber fish in water in a bucket.
你看不见的是水桶里泡在水里的橡胶鱼。

573
00:30:46.140 --> 00:30:50.440
And they really were able to cheat it because Creed's a little bit over the hill, you know?
他们真的成功骗过了观众，因为克里德年纪有点大了，你懂的吧？

574
00:30:50.680 --> 00:30:51.000
Yeah.
是啊。

575
00:30:51.220 --> 00:30:53.620
And he reaches down real fast, and he pulls it out.
他飞快地伸手下去，把它抓了出来。

576
00:30:53.700 --> 00:30:56.080
But I thought Creed did a great job of selling that.
但我认为克里德演得非常逼真。

577
00:30:56.500 --> 00:30:58.140
That was some good hand acting.
那手部动作演得真好。

578
00:30:58.340 --> 00:30:58.980
It was.
确实。

579
00:30:58.980 --> 00:31:04.660
